== S2. D = 20 is a combinatorial integer (no a) ==
  #plaquettes on L=8 torus: 24576 ; #links: 16384
  plaquettes per link: [6]   (= 2(d-1) = 6)
  adjacency degree of a root plaquette: 20   (= 4*(6-1) = 20)
  => D = 20, integer, independent of the lattice spacing a  [T]
  (cross-check: min/max degree over all plaquettes = 20 / 20)
